backend/embedded_clients/
build/
sandbox/embedded_guest/

# What `make release` builds and `make publish` uploads.
/dist/

# `make build` leaves the client in the root: `john` everywhere, and `john.exe`
# on Windows, where it carries an extension.
john
john.exe

# macOS leaves these in every directory it has been looked at in.
.DS_Store

# gokit is a dependency, pinned in go.mod and fetched like any other. A
# checkout of it here is a convenience for working on both at once, and it is
# not anyone else's to clone: tracking it as a bare gitlink only ever gave a
# fresh clone an empty directory.
/gokit/

# What `make e2e` leaves: one directory per run, with its screen, trace and review.
/e2e/runs/
.gstack/

